/S /H3
/P 83 0 R
/T (LockBit dominates the anomaly roster with 92 flagged samples \(28.1% of all anomalies\), followed by Dharma \(36\), Ryuk \(25\), WannaCry \(25\), and REvil \(24\). SHAP TreeExplainer applied to the Isolation Forest on the highest-scoring sample \(ensemble score = 22.15\) identifies registry_delete and registry_total as the primary anomaly drivers, consistent with LockBit's aggressive shadow copy deletion behaviour. Secondary contributors include network_connections and network_http, reflecting LockBit's C2 exfiltration activity prior to encryption initiation.)
/E (LockBit dominates the anomaly roster with 92 flagged samples \(28.1% of all anomalies\), followed by Dharma \(36\), Ryuk \(25\), WannaCry \(25\), and REvil \(24\). SHAP TreeExplainer applied to the Isolation Forest on the highest-scoring sample \(ensemble score = 22.15\) identifies registry_delete and registry_total as the primary anomaly drivers, consistent with LockBit's aggressive shadow copy deletion behaviour. Secondary contributors include network_connections and network_http, reflecting LockBit's C2 exfiltration activity prior to encryption initiation.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
